{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the world of classic puzzles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1. It's easy for anyone to learn</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Push the block and use ice, conveyor belt, and walls to reach BLOCK+HOLE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fall into the charm of class puzzle games with simple rules and in-depth gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rule 1. Number blocks and pushing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612000/extras/Tutorial_Normal.gif?t=1744472465\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the basic block, moves one space at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each time you move, the number of moves displayed on the block decreases by one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A block whose number of moves becomes 0 cannot be moved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put number blocks into all holes prepared to clear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rule 2. Ice Block</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612000/extras/Tutorial_Ice.gif?t=1744472465\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ice blocks take one movement to slide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The slipped block moves until it meets a basic block or wall block.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rule 3. Conveyor Belt</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612000/extras/Tutorial_ConveyorBelt.gif?t=1744472465\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The conveyor belt moves the number block in the direction indicated by the arrow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The number of moves is not counted while you are on the conveyor belt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rule 4. Wall blocks and number blocks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612000/extras/Tutorial_Wall.gif?t=1744472465\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is impossible to move where wall blocks and number blocks are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you build a wall using number blocks, you can create a new movement path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2. level maker</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you've enjoyed all the stages you've prepared, create your own level,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Share it with other users.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An infinite world of puzzles awaits you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3612000?t=1744472465","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612000/0fddd5e0914614dc43c043881c68ddbbefff95b5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744472465","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612000/5c8f4546847b4c7d1be3e020ce14bc5754e88ff9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744472465","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612000/5c8f4546847b4c7d1be3e020ce14bc5754e88ff9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744472465","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the world of classic puzzles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1. It's easy for anyone to learn</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Push the block and use ice, conveyor belt, and walls to reach BLOCK+HOLE.</p><p class=\"