eamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612000/extras/Tutorial_Wall.gif?t=1744472465\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is impossible to move where wall blocks and number blocks are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you build a wall using number blocks, you can create a new movement path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2. level maker</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you've enjoyed all the stages you've prepared, create your own level,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Share it with other users.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An infinite world of puzzles awaits you.</p>","developers":["CloudWhaleGameLab."],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612000/7c10b4a1dd7ebedcde02c05d5bd980145c2e0485/header.jpg?t=1744472465","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257117924,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117924/movie480.mp4?t=1744472464","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117924/movie_max.mp4?t=1744472464"},"name":"BLOCK+HOLE Gameplay Video","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257117924/8bc3fdeb268f73b497563baf92f1bf716bddc3e7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744472464","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117924/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744472464","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117924/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744472464"}}],"name":"BLOCK+HOLE","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7, 8, 10, 11 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX compatible graphics card, integrat